:''For the enemy encountered in the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]], see [[The 6th Angel (Enemy)|The 6th Angel]].''
'''The 6th Angel''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 549
|rarity = UR
|name1 = The 6th Angel
|name2 = 6th Angel Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''6th Angel Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
The 6th Angel is a dangerous anti-[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] nuker with a small blindspot, a high standing range of 500 bolstered by its [[Long Distance]] reaching up to 1500, slowing those that survive to inhibit their pushing power, though the uptime is too low and should not be relied upon. Its low DPS, extreme cooldown and long attack cycle of nearly 23 seconds precludes general use (even though it can snipe the enemy base with terrifying ease) and its [[Dodge Attack|Dodge]] is obviously inconsistent, but this is bumped up with its [[Massive Damage]] ability versus Floating and a 100% level 3 [[Surge Attack]]. Assuming both the main attack and all hits from the Surge connect, it can potentially deal up to 544,000 damage to Floating at just level 30, and 864,000 at level 50, although in practice this tends to be lower due to its wide spawn area.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Nuker}}

