==Trivia==
*This unit is tied with [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Nerd Cat]] for the highest [[Long Distance]] reach of any cat unit, at 1,500.
**If counting [[:Category:PC Exclusive Content|PC Exclusive]] units, it and Nerd Cat would be tied for second place, behind [[Natsu Mikan (PC Uber Rare Cat)|Nouryou Natsu Mikan]]'s maximum LD reach of 3,000.

